            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An integrated circuit comprising an elongate substrate having a length, a thickness, and a width, the length being at least twenty times the width. On the elongate substrate there is provided a plurality of nozzles arranged in a column along the length of the elongate substrate, a plurality of memory cells arranged adjacent to the plurality of nozzles, each memory cell corresponding to a nozzle, and fluid actuation logic to either eject fluid from selected nozzles or access memory cells corresponding to the selected nozzles.</p>
